Model weights are research use only. Two of the twenty sources in the training
mix carry non-commercial terms: XNLI (CC-BY-NC-4.0, facebookresearch/XNLI) and
RACE ("available for non-commercial research purpose only"). Two more state no
licence at all: ucirvine/sms_spam and cardiffnlp/tweet_sentiment_multilingual.

Evaluation suites built from non-commercial sources are not distributed here:
XNLI, FinancialPhraseBank (CC-BY-NC-SA-3.0) and RACE, whose terms forbid
redistributing derived data. benchmarks/README.md rebuilds them from source.
Per-source licences for both the training mix and the benchmarks are in
docs/benchmarks.md.

